stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Reachable
  Reachable --> Candidate: Unreferenced per signed GitGit full graph
  Candidate --> Candidate: Replica lag, inflight upload, lease, legal hold or stale watermark
  Candidate --> Tombstone: Grace expired AND re-check epoch with Raft
  Tombstone --> Protected: New reference or retention arrives
  Protected --> Reachable: Cancel delete
  Tombstone --> DeleteReady: Re-check reachability and placement
  DeleteReady --> Deleted: Physical removal after commit
  Deleted --> [*]
